<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-22T16:30:00.040Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 16:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces have entered the Iran-backed militia strongholds of Jurf al-Sakhar and Jurf al-Nasr, establishing new posts to protect oil pipelines and checkpoints after a deal with the militia. The Prime Minister ordered a probe into a deadly gas pipeline blast in Basra and an oil smuggling case in Najaf, issuing an arrest warrant for a provincial council member. Security forces also seized checkpoints in a Kataib Hezbollah area and killed senior ISIS figures in Diyala and northeastern Iraq, while a new Shiite group, Asa'ib Al-Jihad, announced its formation and ISIS sleeper cells remain a threat in Kirkuk. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOdGtDVUVuSFA3aldyV3lnZHhnTlJoYm9pa05NNGgyLU85amVrVmRQTU1SZEJjcUJCVFljM0RzOHc5aVhmOTR2c285RnRpRTI1MWpTOW52TG9tRWkySUNtbFQ2RDcxYnAxcG1Kc3BlUmtPekxkcGZyMk5BdTZNeWhYX0NkNTZoWVUzMU02LVlvUVNnVXJCUndZZzRIbEw?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPX3RRM3pFNmxuU205M2lTa0w0WnB0MlNKY05udmh3S2RBTFF1OGdnR3hLVkFjdk1fTldjNHlRLVZ5eUl4ZTNZY0hjOU5DZUJkQnpfZThPS0FaZXI5VzhIYUhpRUVublhUTXltajFRa1VLY1R1bjUwNzZRdUFOaG8wZ2JUd3FxcGhwQTc0MXM0OTYwaUtBSVRzWGMxWVQ3RjhjN0wtcTBZbGhjblBRMnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Qatar news agency&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNSDBaTkpWZVpKdDVwNHVhdFVfdHJFOFo3Sy1WTnE4VC1qcHFWNW91TENSWWxESDFnOHlUQXlVc0daTEJyU2hiRXBrdW1wOXZtam5qaFJjVWQ2R3VGSmJxMk9DM2ozem1lLTFUeWlBb1ZSWmd0